portconf was written by megabaks <https://github.com/megabaks>.

It is currently maintained by Ivan S. Titov <iohann.s.titov@gmail.com>
at <https://github.com/istitov/portconf>.

    The 2.0.0 modernization (autotools build, 280-test bats suite across
    three tiers, env-overridable system path roots, qatom 0.97+ parser
    rewrite, 15 latent bugs fixed) was carried out with heavy use of the
    Claude large-language model (Anthropic) as a coding assistant; every
    change was reviewed by hand and validated against the bats unit /
    integration / smoke layers, shellcheck, and `make distcheck` before
    landing.  See the 2.0.0 entry in ChangeLog for per-commit detail.
